{
    "name": "target-per-period-a-level-with-no-entry-in-the-map-has-no-target",
    "why": "Owner decision M's map names the levels this rule is ABOUT, so a level absent from it has NO target — which is a different statement from a target of zero, and the two are a whole department apart. p-noor is an R3 with nine duties in the block and is not judged at all; defaulting an unmapped level to zero would flag them for every duty they took, and a consultant who never logs in would acquire nine violations on their first block. p-ali's five against an R1 target of four is the other half: the rule still fires, so a green run cannot mean nothing was measured.",
